WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:02,240
The Zhongzhou enforcers also arrested many people.

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,840
Every time I get paid, I feel like giving it away.

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,840
He risked his life to save people

4
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,840
You don’t care about this little reward.

5
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,840
No enforcers guarding the border

6
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:12,840
You can still sit here peacefully

7
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:13,840
You are also an executive

8
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:17,060
Why can't you turn out?

9
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,060
I'm not saying they are outsiders

10
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:21,060
It’s really hard to recognize

11
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,060
If you have the ability, go to Nanjing to be an executor.

12
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,180
If you don’t participate, just say a few words.

13
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:27,180
If you don't accept it, go to the western border of Nanjing to do the mission.

14
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:29,180
If your ability is insufficient, practice more

15
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:36,780
Don't just complain

16
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:39,260
The Special Bureau is different from what I thought

17
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:41,490
What do you think it is

18
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:43,710
Unity, passion and unity to the outside world

19
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:45,710
Wherever there are people, there will be comparisons and disputes

20
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:48,100
Recruiting on a large scale now

21
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:50,450
There will only be more conflicts

22
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:52,770
Don't care

23
00:00:52,770 --> 00:00:54,770
When things happen, someone will naturally handle it

24
00:00:54,770 --> 00:00:56,770
Those people are not the only ones in the Special Bureau.
